## Our Audio Visual Rental Packages

Every rental is an all inclusive package: setup, transport and teardown are handled by our team. Pricing is transparent and shown per package on our [packages page](/packages/), where every rate renders live from our catalog (prices are ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added on top). You see exactly what each package includes before you commit, instead of chasing a vague quote.

| Package | Best for | Guest capacity |
| --- | --- | --- |
| [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) | Private parties and small celebrations | Up to 50 |
| [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) | Weddings, with a live on site technician | Up to 80 |
| [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) | Product launches and dealership showcases | Presentation focused |
| [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) | Executive meetings and small conferences | Up to 40 |
| [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) | Conferences and corporate events, LED display plus technician | Up to 120 |

See live pricing and full inclusions on our [packages page](/packages/).

## Audio Visual Equipment We Rent in Malaga

Our catalog covers the four building blocks of any event setup:

-   **Sound**: active PA speaker systems, mixing consoles and crystal clear reinforcement, scaled from intimate rooms to 120 guest conferences.
-   **Visual**: Full HD 5000 lumen laser projectors with projection screens, plus a premium 60 inch LED display for high impact corporate visuals.
-   **Lighting**: RGBW LED spotlights, warm fairy light strings for weddings, and ambient setups tuned to your venue.
-   **Microphones**: wired dynamic, wireless handheld and professional gooseneck lectern microphones for speeches and panels.

Optional add ons include a methacrylate lectern, modular staging and professional smoke machines.

## Serving Malaga and the Whole Costa del Sol

We are based in Malaga and deliver across the Costa del Sol, including Marbella, Fuengirola, Torremolinos, Benalmadena, Estepona and Mijas, with wider coverage reaching Sevilla, Granada, Ronda, Nerja and Antequera. The congress at Hotel Alfonso XIII and the hospital conference in Marbella you can see in our gallery both sit inside this service area.

## Delivery, Setup and Teardown Included

We run a delivery only model: our crew brings the gear, installs it professionally, tests the sound and lighting, and comes back after your event to collect everything. You never touch the equipment yourself. On our larger corporate packages a dedicated technician stays on site to run the show, so a microphone that cuts out or a projector that will not connect is our problem to solve, not yours.

## Rental vs. Full Production Company

Not every event needs a full production crew, and not every event can run on a self serve equipment drop either. Our model sits between the two.

For a private party or small celebration, the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) is delivery, setup and teardown only, no technician required on site. For a wedding, corporate conference or product launch, packages like the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) add a live technician for the hours that matter, so you get hands on production support without booking a separate production company. We recently ran exactly that model at [PROGOLD SUMMIT 2026 in Torremolinos](/blog/news-malaga-event-gear-delivers-flawless-audiovisual-production-at-progold-summit-2026-in-torremolinos/), handling the full audiovisual production for the conference.

