## FAQ

### What types of events does Malaga Event Gear cater to?

Malaga Event Gear specializes in providing audio visual rental services for an array of events such as weddings, corporate meetings, private parties, and seminars.

### What is the MICE Pack offered by Malaga Event Gear?

The MICE Pack is a comprehensive audiovisual setup ideal for corporate meetings, conferences, and exhibitions. It includes top notch equipment such as a 60 inch screen, a high quality sound system, and various microphone options.

### How does Malaga Event Gear ensure a seamless event experience?

Our dedicated team at Malaga Event Gear provides tailored service, assisting with setup and operation of audiovisual equipment, ensuring seamless integration of dynamic lighting and sound solutions for a flawless event execution.

### What makes Malaga Event Gear's wedding and Eco Packs unique?

Our Wedding and Eco Packs feature dynamic lighting and advanced sound systems that transform any venue into a breathtaking space, ensuring unforgettable audio and visual experiences for your celebration.

### How can I book audiovisual equipment from Malaga Event Gear?

Booking with Malaga Event Gear is straightforward. Visit our website, select your rental options, fill out our booking form with your event details, and our team will confirm your booking for a hassle-free experience.

### How much does audio visual rental cost in Malaga?

Pricing depends on the package: our full catalog, from the Eco Pack for small private parties up to the MICE Pack for large conferences, is listed with exact euro pricing on our [packages page](/packages/). All rates are ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout, and every price includes delivery, setup and teardown.

### What audio visual equipment can I rent from Malaga Event Gear?

Our catalog covers active PA sound systems, Full HD laser projectors and screens, a premium 60 inch LED display, RGBW LED lighting and fairy light strings, plus wired, wireless and gooseneck microphones. See the full breakdown in [Audio Visual Equipment We Rent in Malaga](#audio-visual-equipment-we-rent-in-malaga) above.

### What areas does Malaga Event Gear serve?

We are based in Malaga and serve the wider Costa del Sol, including Marbella, Fuengirola, Torremolinos, Benalmadena, Estepona and Mijas, with wider coverage reaching Sevilla, Granada, Ronda, Nerja and Antequera.

### How far in advance should I book audio visual equipment in Malaga?

Book as early as you can once your event date is confirmed. Demand on the Costa del Sol peaks during wedding season, from April through October, when technicians and the most requested packages fill up first. Corporate bookings tied to a fixed conference date should also lock in the package early rather than wait for a final headcount.

### What is the difference between renting AV equipment and hiring a full production company?

It depends on the event. Our [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) is a delivery, setup and teardown service for private parties, no technician required. For weddings and corporate events, packages like the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) add a live technician on site for the hours that matter, closing the gap between a bare equipment rental and hiring a separate production company. See [Rental vs. Full Production Company](#rental-vs-full-production-company) above.
